GB – lên đến 450.000/900.000 IOPS\u003cbr /\u003e1024GB – lên đến 900.000/1.000.000 IOPS\u003cbr /\u003e2048GB – lên đến 1.000.000/1.000.000 IOPS\u003cbr /\u003e4096GB – lên đến 1.000.000/1.000.000 IOPS\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:72px;text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"height:72px;width:213.328px;\"\u003eTổng số byte được ghi (TBW)\u003csup class=\"footnote-sub\"\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height:72px;width:596.578px;\"\u003e512GB – 400TBW\u003cbr /\u003e1024GB – 800TBW\u003cbr /\u003e2048GB – 1,6PBW\u003cbr /\u003e4096GB – 3,2PBW\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:72px;text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"height:72px;width:213.328px;\"\u003eTiêu thụ điện năng\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height:72px;width:596.578px;\"\u003e512GB – Nghỉ 5W / Trung bình 0,34mW / Đọc 2,7W (TỐI ĐA) / Ghi 4,1W (TỐI ĐA)\u003cbr /\u003e1024GB – Nghỉ 5W / Trung bình 0,33mW / Đọc 2,8W (TỐI ĐA)/ Ghi 6,3W (TỐI ĐA)\u003cbr /\u003e2048GB – Nghỉ 5W / Trung bình 0,36mW / Đọc 2,8W (TỐI ĐA)/ Ghi 9,9W (TỐI ĐA)\u003cbr /\u003e4096GB – Nghỉ 5W / Trung bình 0,36mW / Đọc 2,7W (TỐI ĐA)/ Ghi 10,2W (TỐI ĐA)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:18px;text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"height:18px;width:213.328px;\"\u003eNhiệt độ bảo quản\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height:18px;width:596.578px;\"\u003e-40°C~85°C\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:18px;text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"height:18px;width:213.328px;\"\u003eNhiệt độ vận hành\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height:18px;width:596.578px;\"\u003e0°C~70°C\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:36px;text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"height:36px;width:213.328px;\"\u003eKích thước\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"height:36px;width:596.578px;\"\u003e80mm x 22mm x 2,21mm (512GB-1024GB)\u003cbr /\u003e80mm x 22mm x 3,5mm (2048GB-4096GB)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"heigh